=== A: three cycles of $past in place of a history variable
--- informal-bmc, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
a_past3                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 5
=== B: the history variable
--- informal-kind, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
a_seen                       assert  proven        informal-kind
c_late                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 5
--- informal-kind, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
a_seen                       assert  cex           informal-kind depth 1
c_late                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 3
=== C: k-th word out equals k-th word in, history variable
--- informal-kind, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_k                          assume  unprocessed
a_hist                       assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_popk                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 11
--- ric3-ic3, limit 60s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_k                          assume  unprocessed
a_hist                       assert  proven        ric3-ic3
c_popk                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 11
=== D: prophecy checked at the pop, asserted at the push
--- informal-bmc, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_k                          assume  unprocessed
m_pv                         assume  unprocessed
m_check                      assume  unprocessed
a_proph                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 1
=== E: the same prophecy, asserted at the pop
--- informal-kind, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_k                          assume  unprocessed
m_pv                         assume  unprocessed
m_check                      assume  unprocessed
a_proph_late                 assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_popk                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 11
--- ric3-ic3, limit 60s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_k                          assume  unprocessed
m_pv                         assume  unprocessed
m_check                      assume  unprocessed
a_proph_late                 assert  proven        ric3-ic3
c_popk                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 11
